OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver convicted after
OL,4,Avillage bridge wrecked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been convicted of driving a
OL,7,Florry without due care and attention
OL,8,Fafter he drove into a brick bridge.
OL,10,FDaniel Gowers, of Dunedin Road,
OL,11,FHavering, was found guilty of striking
OL,12,Fthe bridge in Swallowfield, Berkshire,
OL,13,Fon 11 February.
OL,15,FThe 33-year-old was fined #1,100,
OL,16,Fordered to pay a #440 surcharge and
OL,17,F#130 in costs, and given nine points on
OL,18,Fhis driving licence in his absence at
OL,19,FReading Magistrates' Court on 15
OL,20,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
