OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver convicted after
OL,4,Avillage bridge wrecked
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicle smashed one side of the
OL,7,Fbrick wall and forced a closure of the
OL,8,Froad for more than a fortnight. Work to
OL,9,Frepair it began on 28 September, with a
OL,10,Froad closure required so that the
OL,11,Fparapet could be replaced safely.
